We are here to promote your freedom
Our work begins by asking ourselves, “Is it free?” because
our purpose is to respect your individual user needs, autonomy, and right
to decide for yourself.  We empower people to build a future built
on free software that, above all, puts the user first.
By supporting our work, you help support everyone's rights.
